      "details": "<p>*Atuna is\u00a0often identified as classical\u00a0Tynna, but that proposal\u00a0is not entirely certain. If it proves correct, then\u00a0<span>*Atuna and Tynna should be regarded as one and the same city. If not, then one\u00a0should probably look further north for *Atuna, near\u00a0<span>Boh\u00e7a, ca. 40 km west of Kayseri, since a Luwian inscription of Kurtis was discovered there.</span></span></p>",
